# LoC MARC language code → YSO bridge with multilingual labels.
#
# Parallel to vocab/loc-countries-bridge.ttl (see L-12 in
# docs/bffi_limitations.md for the rationale). LoC publishes
# language URIs at <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/languages/{code}>
# but with English labels only; the Helmet cataloguer audience
# needs fi/sv/en. YSO has the language concepts under main YSO
# (`yso:p2573` "englannin kieli" etc.) but neither LoC nor YSO
# publishes a cross-reference between the two URI spaces, so this
# bridge ships the link locally.
#
# Source: MARC 008 positions 35-37 (language of the resource)
# and MARC 041 $a / $h. LoC MARC List for Languages.
#
# Licence: CC0 (project bridge; YSO labels are Finto-curated CC0).

@prefix loc:  <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/languages/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix yso:  <http://www.yso.fi/onto/yso/> .

@prefix bridge: <http://urn.fi/URN:NBN:fi:bib:bridge/loc-languages/> .

bridge: a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "Local LoC MARC language code ↔ YSO bridge"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Project-owned bridge — see docs/bffi_limitations.md L-12 (sibling of the LoC countries bridge)."@en .

loc:aar  skos:exactMatch yso:p38727 ;
         skos:prefLabel  "afarin kieli"@fi,
